OL,3,AWe thought mum abandoned us - then we
OL,4,Adiscovered she'd been murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the sentencing, her eldest son
OL,7,FSinan Mehmet said he and his siblings
OL,8,Fhad believed their mother had abandoned
OL,9,Fthem, leaving them feeling resentful.
OL,10,F"We always felt like we were unwanted,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
